		{"id":"280ad972b5d465b5","type":"text","text":"```text\n.\n└── Data/\n    ├── Structured/\n    │   ├── Calendar/\n    │   └── Good-Day/\n    │       └── Actions/\n    └── Unstructured/\n        ├── Vision/ (treated as files)\n        ├── Daily/\n        │   ├── emails/\n        │   ├── chats/\n        │   └── meetings/\n        ├── Knowledge/\n        │   ├── PO Reports/\n        │   │   ├── weekly/\n        │   │   └── monthly/\n        │   ├── PMO Reports/\n        │   └── Company HQ Policies/\n        └── Inferred Knowledge/\n            ├── Memory (Fact)/\n            │   ├── weekly/\n            │   └── decay or change/\n            └── Registry/\n                └── evolving memory/\n```","x":560,"y":1880,"width":546,"height":655},
